'Rumination':'Rumination is when our mind plays the same sad or bad memory again and again, like a song stuck on repeat. Going for a walk, talking to someone or doing something with our hands helps us press "stop".',
'Intolerance of Uncertainty':'Some people find "not knowing" very hard. But nobody knows everything about tomorrow. We can trust God with what we don\'t know and take one step at a time.',
