'Authenticity vs. Adaptation':'Sometimes we change ourselves to fit in. It is good to be kind to others, and also good to be the real you.',
'Self-Compassion':'Self-compassion means being kind to yourself when you make a mistake, like you would be kind to a friend.',
'Attachment Styles':'When we are little, we learn how close we can be to people. If it felt unsafe then, safe people now can help us learn to trust.',
'Emotional Dependency':'This is needing one person to make us feel okay all the time. It is good to have many safe people, and God, to lean on.',
