'Jealousy & Insecurity':'Jealousy is being scared someone we love will love someone else more. Talking honestly and feeling secure in God\'s love help.',
'Difficulty Trusting':'After someone hurts us, it can be hard to trust again. Trust grows slowly with safe people.',
'Repeating Relationship Patterns':'Sometimes the same problems happen with different people. Noticing the pattern is the first step to changing it.',
'Emotional Unavailability':'This is when someone finds it hard to share feelings or be close. Small steps of opening up help.',
'Fear of Intimacy':'This is being scared to let people know the real you. Being known and still loved is what we were made for.',
'Family Roles':'In families, people sometimes play parts like "the helper" or "the funny one." You can be more than your part.',
