'Emotional Flashbacks':'Sometimes we suddenly feel like a scared child again, even though we are safe now. Breathing and noticing where we are help.',
'Dissociation':'Sometimes when things are too much, our mind goes far away to protect us. Feeling our feet on the floor helps us come back.',
