'Emotional Triggers':'A trigger is something that suddenly makes a big feeling come up. Knowing your triggers helps you get ready for them.',
'Window of Tolerance':'Imagine a window. Inside it, we feel calm enough to think. Too high, we feel panicky; too low, we feel numb. Breathing and resting help us get back inside the window.',
'Hyperarousal':'This is when our body is too "switched on", like a car with the accelerator stuck. Slow breaths press the brake.',
