'Down-Regulation: Calming an Activated System':'When we are too wound up, slow breathing, quiet and a hug help our body calm down.',
'Up-Regulation: Energising a Shut-Down System':'When we feel too slow or flat, a walk, music or cold water on the face can gently wake us up.',
