'The Spotlight of Attention':'Attention is like a torch. Whatever you shine it on gets bigger in your mind. Shine it on good things.',
'The State Dial':'Your mood is like a dial from "sleepy" to "too fast". Different tools turn the dial up or down.',
'The Four Attachment Styles':'There are four ways people learn to be close to others. With safe love, anyone can learn to feel secure.',
'The Four Communication Styles':'We can talk in four ways: too quiet, too pushy, sneaky, or clear and kind. Clear and kind is best.',
'The Four Stress Responses':'When we feel danger, we might fight, run, freeze or try to please. Each one is the body trying to protect us.',
